translation.adminHydration.reasonCount	{{reason}} ({{count, number}})
translation.adminHydration.moreIds	{{count, number}} more not shown
translation.adminJobs.actions	Actions
translation.adminJobs.batch.help	Each entry has args matching the task's schema and an optional dedupe_key. Up to 100,000 entries / 64 MiB. Requests are sent in bounded batches; each 100-job chunk commits independently. Invalid entries are skipped. Keep this dialog open until finished. Arguments are not included in errors or audit logs.
translation.adminJobs.batch.file	JSON file
translation.adminJobs.batch.delay	Delay for all entries (seconds, up to 7 days)
translation.adminJobs.batch.pace	Pace (jobs per minute)
translation.adminJobs.batch.paceHelp	Spreads the entries out so the backfill adds about this many jobs a minute to the queue, instead of all at once. Leave blank to enqueue every entry at the delay.
translation.adminJobs.batch.invalidPace	Enter a number of jobs per minute above zero.
translation.adminJobs.batch.paceTooSlow	At this pace the last entry would be due more than 7 days out.
translation.adminJobs.batch.fileTooLarge	The JSON file must be at most 64 MiB.
translation.adminJobs.batch.invalidFile	Upload valid JSON containing an array of 1–100,000 entries.
translation.adminJobs.batch.reading	Reading JSON…
translation.adminJobs.batch.ready_one	{{count}} entry ready
translation.adminJobs.batch.ready_other	{{count}} entries ready
translation.adminJobs.batch.enqueue	Enqueue batch…
translation.adminJobs.batch.confirmTitle_one	Enqueue {{count}} entry?
translation.adminJobs.batch.confirmTitle_other	Enqueue {{count}} entries?
translation.adminJobs.batch.confirmDescription	Run {{task}} for every valid entry. Each job uses the account from its arguments, or the system account for account-less tasks. Existing pending dedupe keys are skipped. Completed chunks cannot be undone.
translation.adminJobs.batch.progress	{{processed}} / {{total}} entries processed: {{enqueued}} enqueued, {{skipped}} deduplicated, {{failed}} errors
translation.adminJobs.batch.stopped	Upload stopped. Some jobs in the last request may have committed without a confirmed response. Later requests were not sent. Check jobs before retrying; do not re-upload the whole file blindly.
translation.adminJobs.batch.entryError	Entry {{index}}: {{detail}}
translation.adminJobs.batch.previousErrors	Previous errors
translation.adminJobs.batch.nextErrors	Next errors
translation.adminJobs.batch.fileHelp	A JSON array of entries shaped like the example below.
translation.adminJobs.batch.source	Entries source
translation.adminJobs.batch.sourceFile	Upload file
translation.adminJobs.batch.sourcePaste	Paste JSON
translation.adminJobs.batch.paste	JSON entries
translation.adminJobs.batch.pasteTooLarge	Pasted JSON must be at most 1 MiB. Upload a file for larger batches.
translation.adminJobs.batch.invalidPaste	Paste a JSON array of 1–100,000 entries.
translation.adminJobs.batch.invalidJson	Invalid JSON: {{detail}}
translation.adminJobs.batch.preview	Preview
translation.adminJobs.batch.previewFirst	Preview: first {{shown}} of {{total}} entries
translation.adminJobs.breakGlass.title	Break-glass pause is on
translation.adminJobs.breakGlass.everything	Every queue is paused.
translation.adminJobs.breakGlass.queues	Paused queues: {{names, list}}
translation.adminJobs.breakGlass.tasks	Paused tasks and crons: {{names, list}}
translation.adminJobs.breakGlass.reason	Reason: {{reason}}
translation.adminJobs.breakGlass.source	Set in {{location}}, not on this page. It applies on top of the holds below. Delete the file to lift it.
translation.adminJobs.breakGlass.unreadable	The break-glass file {{location}} can't be used: {{error}}. Dispatchers and workers keep the last version they read.
translation.adminJobs.breakGlass.checkFailed	Couldn't check the break-glass pause: {{error}}. A pause may be on.
translation.adminJobs.control.pauseOrCap	Pause / cap…
translation.adminJobs.control.pauseOrCapNamed	Pause / cap {{name}}
translation.adminJobs.control.notRegisteredQueue	No task or cron in this build uses this queue, so it can't be paused or capped. Lift an existing hold from Active holds.
translation.adminJobs.control.title	Pause or cap {{name}}
translation.adminJobs.control.descriptionQueue	Holds back dispatch of every job on this queue. Takes effect within about a second, with no deploy. Held jobs stay queued and keep their attempts; jobs already running finish.
translation.adminJobs.control.descriptionTask	Holds back dispatch of this task's jobs. Takes effect within about a second, with no deploy. Held jobs stay queued and keep their attempts; jobs already running finish.
translation.adminJobs.control.pause	Pause dispatch
translation.adminJobs.control.maxInFlight	Max in flight
translation.adminJobs.control.maxInFlightHelp	The most jobs dispatched or running at once. Leave empty for no cap.
translation.adminJobs.control.maxInFlightInvalid	Enter a whole number from 1 to 1,000,000, or leave it empty.
translation.adminJobs.control.reason	Reason (shown to other operators and kept in the audit log)
translation.adminJobs.control.cancel	Cancel
translation.adminJobs.control.save	Save
translation.adminJobs.control.lift	Lift hold
translation.adminJobs.control.saveDisabled	Pause dispatch or set a cap to save
translation.adminJobs.control.saved	Hold on {{name}} saved
translation.adminJobs.control.lifted	Hold on {{name}} lifted
translation.adminJobs.control.paused	paused
translation.adminJobs.control.capped	max {{count}} in flight
translation.adminJobs.control.holdsTitle	Active holds
translation.adminJobs.control.holdsHelp	Queues, tasks and crons an operator has paused or capped. Lift a hold to resume normal dispatch.
translation.adminJobs.control.scope	Scope
translation.adminJobs.control.scopeQueue	queue
translation.adminJobs.control.scopeTask	task
translation.adminJobs.control.name	Name
translation.adminJobs.control.hold	Hold
translation.adminJobs.control.reasonColumn	Reason
translation.adminJobs.control.setBy	Set by
translation.adminJobs.control.setAt	Set at
translation.adminJobs.control.edit	Edit…
translation.adminJobs.control.editNamed	Edit {{name}}
translation.adminJobs.control.liftNamed	Lift hold on {{name}}
translation.adminJobs.control.liftOnlyDescription	This build has no queue, task or cron with this name, so the hold can't be changed, only lifted.
translation.adminJobs.requeueFailed	Requeue failed
translation.adminJobs.taskRequeueTitle	Requeue failed jobs for {{task}} on {{queue}}
translation.adminJobs.taskRequeueDescription	Resets only this task's failed jobs on this queue to run again; other tasks are untouched and run history is kept. Jobs whose dedupe key is already pending are skipped.
translation.adminJobs.taskRequeued_one	Requeued {{count}} failed job for {{task}} on {{queue}}
translation.adminJobs.taskRequeued_other	Requeued {{count}} failed jobs for {{task}} on {{queue}}
translation.adminJobs.taskRemaining	{{done}}; {{remaining}} still failed (run again to continue)
translation.adminJobs.enqueue.action	Enqueue…
translation.adminJobs.enqueue.title	Enqueue jobs
translation.adminJobs.enqueue.descriptionSingle	Same path as app.jobs.enqueue() in code. The audit log records task, queue and account, not the arguments.
translation.adminJobs.enqueue.modeSingle	Single job
translation.adminJobs.enqueue.modeBatch	Batch from JSON
translation.adminJobs.enqueue.noTasks	No tasks are registered in this build (JOB_MODULES is empty).
